## Implementation rules

1. Check `STYLE_PLAN.md` for active wave (40–54) before coding
2. Extend pattern owners in `ui-css-audit.md` — no per-page animation files
3. Add reusable tokens to `tokens.css` before one-off keyframes
4. Every new animation: `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` fallback
5. Settings = snappy/subtle; home/lists = stagger; sheets = spring
6. Client-facing (`book.css`, `portal.css`) uses `--cl-*` lane — separate from operator

## Do not

- Implement motion unless explicitly asked or within an active STYLE_PLAN phase
- Duplicate card/sheet rules outside their owners
- Use `transform: none` on floated labels (see `floating-labels` rule)
